  "body": "Consider the following:\r\n```html\r\n<input type=\"range\" value=\"1\" max=\"100\" list=\"number\" />\r\n<datalist id=\"number\">\r\n  <option>10</option>\r\n  <option>15</option>\r\n  <option>30</option>\r\n  <option>50</option>\r\n  <option>90</option>\r\n</datalist>\r\n```\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1148376/112668846-42483d80-8e5f-11eb-868d-c536aa98891a.png)\r\n\r\nThis is just a regular straight input range, But it would be awesome if we could bend it into a circle and get similar effect to this:\r\n\r\n[![enter image description here][1]][1]\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://i.stack.imgur.com/SKxcc.png",
